OL,3,GNEWSADisability adventure centre
OL,4,Aclosing after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outdoor adventure centre for people
OL,7,Fwith disabilities which has operated
OL,8,Ffor more than three decades has
OL,9,Fannounced it will close following
OL,10,F"significant financial and operational
OL,11,Fchallenges".
OL,13,FCalvert Devon, near Wistlandpound
OL,14,FReservoir on Exmoor has offered
OL,15,Factivities such as abseiling,
OL,16,Fzip-lining and canoeing for people with
OL,17,Fphysical, learning, behavioural and
OL,18,Fsensory disabilities since the early
OL,19,F1990s.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
