OL,3,GNEWSADisability adventure centre
OL,4,Aclosing after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, external trustees said
OL,7,Fit was an "extremely difficult
OL,8,Fdecision" that was "not taken lightly
OL,9,Fwith every available avenue explored",
OL,10,Fbut they concluded the centre was "no
OL,11,Flonger financially viable".
OL,13,FThe centre will permanently close at
OL,14,Fthe end of August.
